  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "As we know that, $\\frac{E}{B}=c$\r\n$$\r\n\\text { so, } B=\\frac{E}{c}=\\frac{8}{3 \\times 10^8}=2.66 \\times 10^{-8}\r\n$$",
